    routePath: 'hazari',
    LLM: 'Game: Hazari. 52 cards, 4 players. Phase 1: Partition 13 cards into 3-3-3-4 sets. Phase 2: Sequential comparison of sets using Brag rankings (Troy > Color Run > Run > Color > Pair > High). Scoring: A, K, Q, J, 10 = 10 pts each. Target: 1000.',
    Player: "Welcome to Hazari! You have 13 cards. Divide them into four sets: three sets of 3 cards and one set of four. Call 'Up' when you're ready to compare. High cards (A, K, Q, J, 10) are your point gold! First to 1000 wins.",
    tagline: 'Divide, compare, and conquer. Master the art of partitioning to reach a thousand.',
